# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Staged by build.rs: transcribe-cpp shared runtime libraries (Windows DLLs /
# Linux .so), bundled next to the executable — to the install root via
# tauri.windows.conf.json on Windows, into /usr/lib/Handy (deb/rpm) via
# tauri.conf.json on Linux.
/transcribe-libs/

# Staged by build.rs: llama.cpp's prebuilt llama-server and its libraries, run
# as a helper process for text translation. Bundled as llama/ (tauri.conf.json).
/llama-runtime/
